{"schema":"ordax.profile-content-pack/1","kind":"knowledge-pack","entries":[{"id":"developer.profile-foundation","mediaType":"text/markdown","content":"# Developer Profile\n\nThe Developer Profile is a professional Space profile for code-oriented work.\n\nIts memory scopes are Space and Project. It does not require an external model provider. It does not auto-grant privileges, allow unsigned apps, imply a generic shell, or allow cross-Space memory.","contentSha256":"5c3b7c0cabde90d2a3c459df9ac2fbc54aaeecbc074a685c0001d4e6ca434f2c","source":{"uri":"https://github.com/washingtonmsdj/prototipo-ordax-os/blob/13520d1403d21c9435b42ae476acb0352a4f1ffb/system/profile-packs/developer/v1/manifest.json","revision":"13520d1403d21c9435b42ae476acb0352a4f1ffb","license":"project-owned","jurisdiction":null,"title":"OrdaX Developer Profile manifest"}},{"id":"developer.repository-authority","mediaType":"text/markdown","content":"# Repository authority\n\nFor the OrdaX prototype, Git `main` is the source authority and the USB is not the source authority.\n\nProfile content is a separately versioned/distributed layer and does not become trusted merely because it exists in the repository.","contentSha256":"a9ace18764b005f05e43444dacf72beae6402bbd95211e5d19f840538332c2a2","source":{"uri":"https://github.com/washingtonmsdj/prototipo-ordax-os/blob/13520d1403d21c9435b42ae476acb0352a4f1ffb/docs/CURRENT-STATE.md","revision":"13520d1403d21c9435b42ae476acb0352a4f1ffb","license":"project-owned","jurisdiction":null,"title":"OrdaX current state"}}]}
